    "body": "ZORR MATH LAW — TERMINAL EVIDENCE\n\nSTATE = PASS / ACTIVE IN CONSTITUTION\nMERGED_MAIN = 4514db91f4505699b1ab9624362c7a495a500a0a\nTDD_RED_RUN = 33247917296 (`hq-schema` failed on the new missing-law contract as expected)\nGREEN_RUN = 33247943329\nHQ_SCOPE_GUARD = SUCCESS\nHQ_SCHEMA = SUCCESS\nHQ_CONTROL_TOWER_INTEGRITY = SUCCESS\n\nLAW = MATH / GEOMETRY / TIMING LAW — DO NOT EYEBALL QUANTITATIVE CONSTRAINTS\nREQUIRED_PATTERN = DEFINE -> MEASURE -> CALCULATE -> APPLY -> VERIFY -> RECORD\n\nApplies to proportions, transforms, camera/FOV/framing, timing, trajectories, collision/clearance, kinematics, coordinate conversion and other quantitative spatial/temporal constraints.",
