    "body": "Minimal policy change requested by OWNER: make mathematical verification explicit and mandatory for geometry/timing-sensitive ZORR work.\n\nTDD:\n1. add failing contract requiring Math/Geometry/Timing law;\n2. confirm RED;\n3. add one Constitution section only;\n4. fresh hq-validate green;\n5. merge.\n\nIntended law: for proportions, transforms, camera, timing, trajectories, collision/clearance, spatial relationships and other quantitative constraints, derive/check with explicit math, units, tolerances and reproducible values rather than eyeballing. Artistic judgement still controls style, but quantitative constraints must not be replaced by visual guesswork.",
